ent-GrenadeGaslauncher = gas round
    .desc = Releases a cloud of tear gas.
ent-GrenadeStingerlauncher = stinger round
    .desc = Scatters rubber pellets.
ent-BoxPeacekeeperBaton = peacekeeper baton ammo box
    .desc = A box of less-lethal baton grenades for the Peacekeeper. Remember that less lethal can still kill.
ent-BoxPeacekeeperFlash = peacekeeper flash ammo box
    .desc = A box of flash grenades for the Peacekeeper, useful for catching a fleeing suspect or dispersing crowds.
ent-BoxPeacekeeperGas = peacekeeper tear gas ammo box
    .desc = A box of tear gas grenades for the Peacekeeper. The label reads "DO NOT FORGET INTERNALS" in large red letters.
ent-BoxPeacekeeperStinger = peacekeeper stinger ammo box
    .desc = A box of stinger grenades for the Peacekeeper, excellent for dispersing crowds and attracting lawsuits.
ent-GrenadeFlarelauncher = flare round
    .desc = A grenade round that scatters illuminating pellets on impact.
ent-BoxPeacekeeperFlare = peacekeeper flare ammo box
    .desc = A box of illuminating grenade rounds for the Peacekeeper.
ent-GrenadeEMPlauncher = EMP round
    .desc = A Peacekeeper grenade round that produces an electromagnetic pulse on impact.
ent-BoxPeacekeeperEMP = peacekeeper EMP ammo box
    .desc = A box of electromagnetic pulse grenade rounds for the Peacekeeper.
ent-GrenadeShrapnellauncher = shrapnel round
    .desc = A grenade round that scatters lethal shrapnel after impact.
